---
// 图：双面板——左=理论乘法量（三曲线重合线性下降），右=实测墙钟（三曲线分叉）。示意非实测
---

<figure>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 272" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <g font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">
      <text x="320" y="22" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#0c5f74" text-anchor="middle">算术量确实少了，但墙钟时间不一定——左账与右账的差就是全文主题</text>
      <text x="320" y="40" font-size="9.5" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle">示意曲线（非实测）；具体数值随 kernel、矩阵尺寸与硬件变化</text>

      {/* 左面板 */}
      <text x="165" y="66" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">理论乘法量</text>
      <line x1="55" y1="210" x2="285" y2="210" stroke="#94a3b8"/>
      <line x1="55" y1="80" x2="55" y2="210" stroke="#94a3b8"/>
      <text x="40" y="150" font-size="9" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90 40 150)">剩余乘法</text>
      <text x="170" y="226" font-size="9" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">稀疏率 0% → 80%</text>
      {/* 三条重合下降线 */}
      <line x1="60" y1="88" x2="275" y2="186" stroke="#7fc3d8" stroke-width="2.5"/>
      <line x1="60" y1="90" x2="275" y2="188" stroke="#e6a23c" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6,3"/>
      <line x1="60" y1="86" x2="275" y2="184" stroke="#0f9d68" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="2,3"/>
      <text x="170" y="120" font-size="9.5" fill="#475569" text-anchor="middle">三种粒度都线性下降</text>

      {/* 右面板 */}
      <text x="470" y="66" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">实测墙钟时间</text>
      <line x1="360" y1="210" x2="590" y2="210" stroke="#94a3b8"/>
      <line x1="360" y1="80" x2="360" y2="210" stroke="#94a3b8"/>
      <text x="345" y="150" font-size="9" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90 345 150)">相对耗时</text>
      <text x="475" y="226" font-size="9" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">稀疏率 0% → 80%</text>
      {/* 非结构化：几乎不动 */}
      <path d="M365,90 C440,92 520,96 580,104" fill="none" stroke="#7fc3d8" stroke-width="2.5"/>
      <text x="490" y="86" font-size="9" fill="#006377">非结构化：贴着 1× 走</text>
      {/* 2:4：50% 处跳到 ~0.62 */}
      <path d="M365,90 L468,90 L478,138 L580,138" fill="none" stroke="#e6a23c" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6,3"/>
      <text x="520" y="132" font-size="9" fill="#b97a1f">2:4：50% 处跳一档</text>
      {/* 结构化：近线性 */}
      <path d="M365,90 L580,178" fill="none" stroke="#0f9d68" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="2,3"/>
      <text x="420" y="180" font-size="9" fill="#0a7a50">结构化物理缩形</text>

      <text x="320" y="252" font-size="9.5" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">左账人人都会算；右账取决于压缩表示、稀疏 kernel 与规则度——这就是「稀疏率≠加速」</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
</figure>
